-- The third tour: Ascalon, Kryta, the Maguuma Jungle and the Southern Shiverpeaks.
--
-- Sources: recordings/client/feature/character_creation/maps-tour3.jsonl (0x019A for the map id, the
-- following 0x0196 for blob and spawn) and the client's own tables for names and type
-- (Py4GW_Stealth/py4gw/enums_src/map_enums.py).
--
-- New maps go in whole. A map already in the catalogue keeps its rows and gains only the spawn points
-- this tour saw that it did not have, appended after the ones already recorded - a map entered from a
-- new portal is one more spawn, not a different map.

